    "Question #: 3": {
      "Title": "Exam 4A0-108 topic 1 question 55 discussion - ExamTopics",
      "Question": {
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "Which of the following statements best describes the behavior seen in the network when a receiver joins a multicast channel in the PIM ASM network shown in the exhibit?"
